{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13218360","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13218360","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1321836001:1":{"text":"I have a question for you. I may not have the chance to visit your manor before I leave Whiteridge, so I must ask now.","source_cn":"柳博米尔先生，过些天我就要离开白山了。在离开之前，我恐...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AE7473ABC7BD0D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1321836002:1":{"text":"Go ahead.","source_cn":"请说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA98580B5913F6FBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321836003:1":{"text":"Do you still yearn for eternal death?","source_cn":"你还在追求彻底的死亡吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D37DDA9672EF51E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321836004:1":{"text":"What...?","source_cn":"……什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA092791D76630D90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321836005:1":{"text":"When we met last time, you said immortality is meaningless and what you seek is eternal death. Do you still hold this belief?","source_cn":"你之前说过，永生毫无意义，只有空虚，你所追求的是永恒的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94B5EB75985E0752","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321836006:1":{"text":"If that's the case, I can grant you what you desire now.","source_cn":"如果你还是这样想的，我愿意履行身为亡灵猎人的责任，给你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x084EAF27B54FE515","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321836007:1":{"text":"I...","source_cn":"我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AF11DCC08E871F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321836008:1":{"text":"I still believe immortality is meaningless, but I've come to see that there are ways to make the endless journey less burdensome.","source_cn":"我依旧认为永生是毫无意义的，但或许在通往永生的路上，还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2702414BE893BF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321836009:1":{"text":"The cycle... as you call it. While I don't fully agree with you, I admit that I now see a faint glimmer of light in the perpetual darkness of my life.","source_cn":"就像你说的……循环。我要声明，我并不完全赞同这一点，但...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7288C22D05D4CF18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321836010:1":{"text":"Forgive me... I must retract my earlier words. I will stay—for now, at least—until Orla grows up.","source_cn":"很抱歉，或许我要暂时食言了，亡灵猎人先生。至少在奥尔嘉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE405FECD07AE4325","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321836011:1":{"text":"I will share the history of the Valesa family with her, piece by piece. Then, I will let her decide whether to bear the family name.","source_cn":"我想把瓦勒沙家族的故事一点点讲给她，最后再把是否继承姓...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFF66B28F96EAD0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1321836012:1":{"text":"Very well, then. Might I suggest a pact?","source_cn":"既然如此，柳博米尔先生，我可以和你做一个约定。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2F329045810E797","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1321836013:1":{"text":"I'll return to ask you the same question once you've fulfilled your familial duty.","source_cn":"等到那个时候，等你彻底了结了家族的责任，我会再回来问你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2496DEA2F47DD125","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1321836013":{"text":"I'll return to ask you the same question once you've fulfilled your familial duty.","source_cn":"等到那个时候，等你彻底了结了家族的责任，我会再回来问你同样的问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2496DEA2F47DD125","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1321836014:1":{"text":"Don't make fun of me, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","source_cn":"别开玩笑了，<style=stress><player...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE8F16C0FAF56A240","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Don't make fun of me, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","female":"Don't make fun of me, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","variant_male_record_index":"154138","variant_female_record_index":"154139","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321836016:1":{"text":"To seek eternal death or to find a new purpose... Lord Ludovic, I look forward to seeing what choice you make when the time comes.","source_cn":"在永生的虚无中彻底死亡，或是在漫长生命中找到新生的意义...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B591607AB8CBBD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1321836017:1":{"text":"Heh... Faramor, you're quite inquisitive for an undead hunter, but you're a true friend.","source_cn":"呵……法拉莫尔先生，您是位“多管闲事”的亡灵猎人，但作...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB023048B1436F8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1321836018:1":{"text":"I must return to the manor now. Until we meet again, everyone.","source_cn":"我得回永寂庄园了。各位，再会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F1A973AAFE72C95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","doc